1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,569
FLOWRA multi-company support karta hai

2
00:00:02,569 --> 00:00:06,287
matlab agar aapke paas ek se zyada Tally companies hain

3
00:00:06,287 --> 00:00:10,884
toh aap dashboard ke upar company selector se switch kar sakte hain.

4
00:00:10,884 --> 00:00:16,225
Naam pe click kariye — list khulegi — jo company dekhni hai us pe click kariye.

5
00:00:16,225 --> 00:00:18,997
Data automatic uss company ka aa jaayega.

6
00:00:18,997 --> 00:00:22,918
Waisi hi tarah FY selector — abhi FY 2026-27 selected hai.

7
00:00:22,918 --> 00:00:27,110
Aap 2025-26 ya kisi bhi previous year ka data dekh sakte hain.

8
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,510
Ek tip

9
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:35,473
agar aap sales ya outstanding ka trend dekhna chahte hain toh alag alag FY switch karke compare kariye.

10
00:00:35,473 --> 00:00:39,887
Chalo agle video mein Owner track shuru karte hain — KPI cards padhna seekhenge.
